---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <div class="pb-14">
    <header class="mt-10 sm:mt-6">
      <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
        Hey, I’m Jaakko <span class="align-middle">👋</span>
      </h1>

      <hr class="mt-6 border-0 border-t border-app opacity-40" />

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-muted leading-relaxed text-[15px] sm:text-base">
        <p class="sm">
          I build software across backend, infrastructure, and applied AI.
          I care about simple systems, clean interfaces, and measurable quality.
        </p>

        <p class="sm">
          If I’m not working on a project, I’m usually reading, writing, or
          tuning my homelab.
          <a class="link" href="/blog">I write here</a>.
        </p>

        <p class="sm">
          This site is still work-in-progress, some content may be temporary/placeholders.
        </p>

        <p class="sm">
          Contact: <a class="link" href="mailto:jaakko.lipponen01@gmail.com">jaakko.lipponen01@gmail.com</a>
          · <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jaakko-lipponen/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
          · <a class="link" href="https://github.com/JaakkoLipp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <hr class="mt-6 border-0 border-t border-app opacity-40" />

    <section class="mt-16">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.22em] text-muted2">PORTFOLIO</h2>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-app p-6 sm:p-5">
          <div class="text-app font-semibold">Generative AI testing and evaluation service</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
              Developer-facing backend service for evaluating LLM output and making developing Generative AI systems more testable with DeepEval. 
            </p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
              The system is designed to be modular and scalable. Currently working on this as a part of my master's thesis, in collaboration with Telia Finland.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-app p-6 sm:p-5">
          <div class="text-app font-semibold">Proxmox Cluster Homelab</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
              Personal 4-node proxmox cluster homelab for learning DevOps skills: local LLM models, high availability hosting, kubernetes, and KVM virtualization.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
              Public access to locally hosted services is achieved via a wireguard reverse proxy with a rented VPS.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-app p-6 sm:p-5">
          <div class="text-app font-semibold">Smaller Applied AI & Web Projects</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
            Many other smaller projects varying from ESP32 controlled custom smart light solutions to AI software patchnote summarizers, LLM chatbots on Discord, self hosted web application ci/cd pipelines, ...
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-app p-6 sm:p-5">
          <div class="text-app font-semibold">Academic Research & Principles</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
              A deep-dive bachelor's thesis into AI-driven software development practises and LLM model viability.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
              Graded 4 out of 5 with 600+ downloads as of Q4 2024.
              I aim to ship small and efficient, measure, iterate, automate, and keep the surface area minimal when developing software.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="mt-6 border-0 border-t border-app opacity-40" />

    <section class="mt-16">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.22em] text-muted2">PREVIOUSLY</h2>

      <ol class="mt-8 border-l border-app pl-7 space-y-10">
        <li class="relative">
          <span class="absolute -left-[15px] top-1.5 h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[rgb(var(--fg))]"></span>
          <div class="text-app font-semibold">Technical specialist & masters thesis worker· Telia Finland</div>
          <div class="text-muted2 text-sm mt-1">2023–now · Microservices, evaluation, RAG, infra</div>
          <div class="text-muted mt-2 ">
            Currently building an LLM evaluation platform and internal tooling for quality control of AI outputs. 
            Also worked in key corporate networking solutions fault management, service assurance, network security operations.
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="relative">
          <span class="absolute -left-[15px] top-1.5 h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[rgb(var(--fg))]"></span>
          <div class="text-app font-semibold">M.Sc. Software Engineering · LUT-Univesity</div>
          <div class="text-muted2 text-sm mt-1">2021–2026 · Distributed systems, embedded, networking</div>
          <div class="text-muted mt-2 ">
            Coursework and projects spanning distributes software systems, Linux, databases, and sustainable DevOps practises.
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <hr class="mt-6 border-0 border-t border-app opacity-40" />

    <section class="mt-16">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.22em] text-muted2">USER MANUAL</h2>

      <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-app p-6">
        <p class="text-muted ">
          A short playbook on how I work: preferences, strengths, and how to collaborate effectively. W.I.P.
        </p>

        <a class="link mt-4 inline-block" href="/manual">
          More about me →
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>